description:
The HVM Catapult is a strategic research and innovation organisation for UK manufacturing. Established and supported by Innovate UK, it operates as a co-ordinated national network of six technology and innovation centres, working with industry, academia and government to accelerate industrial transformation and contribute to national missions.
The HVM Catapult centres are:
•	CPI; 
•	Manufacturing Technology Centre (MTC); 
•	National Manufacturing Institute Scotland (NMIS); 
•	NCC; 
•	University
